📦 Parcel Packaging
A delivery company has N parcels to send. Each delivery box can hold a maximum of 12 parcels.
Find the minimum number of boxes required to pack all the parcels.
Input Format:
- The first line contains an integer T, representing the number of test cases.
- Each test case contains one integer N, representing the number of parcels.


#include<stdio.h>
int main(){
    int t,n,min;
    scanf("%d",&t);
    while(t--){
       scanf("%d",&n); //no of parcels
       min=n/12;
       if(n%12!=0)
           min++;
       printf("min boxes %d", min);
    }
    return 0;
}
